        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In the IMAGO Ontology &apos;has figure note&apos; links Print Edition to a literal (string) in order to express knowledge about figures in the print edition and manuscript</rdfs:comment>
